cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in a thesis or publication, please cite it using the
  metadata below (and the Zenodo DOI minted for the release, if one exists).
title: "audio-transcription"
abstract: >-
  Simple offline command-line tool to transcribe audio files (mp3, wav, m4a, flac, ...)
  to plain text, SRT or WebVTT using open-source Whisper models via
  faster-whisper (CTranslate2).
authors:
  - family-names: "Colla Pinheiro"
    given-names: "Felipe"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-0263-2203"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
keywords:
  - speech-to-text
  - automatic speech recognition
  - whisper
  - faster-whisper
  - transcription
  - offline transcription
  - srt
  - vtt
license: MIT
